{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T04:01:12Z","thinking":"**Designing the Structure**\n\nOkay, I'm diving into the `index.html` structure now, aiming for that BillionAir Idle Tycoon look and feel alongside the Parent-Co-Play structure. I'm focusing on a top banner for the parent prompt, `.parent-prompt-signboard`, with a font size of at least 23px. After that, I'm working on the top navigation for the 8 levels.\n\n\n**Defining Level Components**\n\nI've moved on to defining the components for each level, starting with a wardrobe in Level 1. I'm assigning `data-fit` and `data-type` attributes to clothing items, and am planning the `Bin Avatar` card. I've also detailed Level 2's suitcase with allowed items, specifying items to send to the parents. Level 3 includes a security station with a pass card, X-ray screen, and gate detector, and level 4 consists of boarding gates with character ticket cards.\n\n\n**Detailing Level Structures**\n\nI'm now detailing level structures, specifically Level 5, an airplane seat with a plush box, safety sign, and Bin's knight cape, along with a metal buckle and drink button. Level 6 features a cloud window with morphing clouds and Level 7 has emotional buttons and a foot-tucking interaction. Finally, Level 8 is defined with an unbuckle latch, carousel with a red bear suitcase, and a \"EXCELLENT YOUNG PASSENGER\" badge modal.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Airport BillionAir Style)</title>\n    <!-- Google Fonts Nunito với fallback hệ thống mượt mà -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Level 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Level 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC CHO BÉ (PARENT PROMPT BANNER) -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-icon\" class=\"prompt-icon-badge\">👕</span>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC THOẢI MÁI\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-1\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <div class=\"wardrobe-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tủ đồ 6 món trộn lẫn -->\n                    <div class=\"wardrobe-cabinet\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-fit=\"true\" data-type=\"shirt\" aria-label=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👕</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Áo thun</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-fit=\"false\" data-type=\"jeans\" aria-label=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👖</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Quần bò</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-fit=\"true\" data-type=\"pants\" aria-label=\"Quần thun co giãn\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🩳</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Quần thun</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-fit=\"false\" data-type=\"dress\" aria-label=\"Bộ liền rườm rà\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👗</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Bộ liền</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-fit=\"true\" data-type=\"shoes\" aria-label=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👟</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Giày dán</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-fit=\"false\" data-type=\"boots\" aria-label=\"Giày nhiều dây\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 42px;\">🥾</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; color: #37474F;\">Giày dây</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Nhân vật Bé Bin -->\n                    <div class=\"bin-character-frame\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-dress-target\" class=\"bin-avatar-card\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 64px;\">🧒</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-shirt\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-pants\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-slot-shoes\" class=\"bin-slot-item\">⚪</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-1\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đi Xếp Vali Nào! 🧳 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-2\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"suitcase-arena\">\n                    <!-- Đồ vật bên trái -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile luggage-item-lvl2\" data-to-parents=\"false\" aria-label=\"Gấu bông\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\">🧸</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Gấu bông</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile luggage-item-lvl2\" data-to-parents=\"false\" aria-label=\"Quần áo\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\">👕</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Quần áo</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile luggage-item-lvl2\" data-to-parents=\"true\" aria-label=\"Kéo nhọn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\">✂️</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Kéo nhọn</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Vali Đỏ dán Sticker Gấu -->\n                    <div id=\"suitcase-target-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-box-red\">\n                        <div class=\"suitcase-handle\"></div>\n                        <div id=\"suitcase-inner-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-inner-grid\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"suitcase-bear-badge\">🐻</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Đồ vật bên phải -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile luggage-item-lvl2\" data-to-parents=\"false\" aria-label=\"Bàn chải\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\">🪥</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bàn chải</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile luggage-item-lvl2\" data-to-parents=\"true\" aria-label=\"Bình nước lớn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\">🍼</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Bình lớn</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile luggage-item-lvl2\" data-to-parents=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 40px;\">👒</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900;\">Mũ che</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-2\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đến Sân Bay Thôi! 🚗 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-3\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"security-station-grid\">\n                    <!-- Trạm 1: Đưa vé -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 48px;\">👩‍✈️</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #1E88E5;\">1. Gửi Vé</span>\n                        <div id=\"pass-card-lvl3\" class=\"boarding-pass-chunky\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900;\">✈️ VÉ CỦA BIN</div>\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">🎟️</div>\n                            <div id=\"stamp-badge-lvl3\" class=\"stamp-badge\">ĐÃ DUYỆT ✓</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trạm 2: Máy soi X-quang dạ quang -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #00897B;\">2. Máy Soi Chiếu</span>\n                        <div class=\"xray-screen-neon\">\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"🧸\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👕\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👒\">?</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"conveyor-belt\" style=\"width: 85%; margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Trạm 3: Cổng an ninh -->\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #5E35B1;\">3. Cổng An Ninh</span>\n                        <div id=\"gate-detector-lvl3\" class=\"gate-detector-chunky\">\n                            <div class=\"gate-lamps-row\">\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-walker-lvl3\" class=\"kid-walker\" style=\"font-size: 52px;\">🧒</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-3\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Đi Tìm Cửa Bay Nào! 🚪 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY & NỐI VÉ ĐA NHÂN VẬT\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-4\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"boarding-hall-arena\">\n                    <!-- Hàng 4 nhân vật cầm vé -->\n                    <div class=\"characters-queue-row\">\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"rabbit\" data-gate=\"01\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 32px;\">🐰</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Bạn Thỏ</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 01</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"bear\" data-gate=\"02\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 32px;\">🐻</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Bạn Gấu</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 02</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"bin\" data-gate=\"03\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 32px;\">🧒</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Bé Bin</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 03</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"character-ticket-card\" data-char=\"dino\" data-gate=\"05\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 32px;\">🦖</span>\n                            <div>\n                                <strong>Khủng Long</strong>\n                                <div style=\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px;\">Vé 05</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- 4 Cổng bay lớn phong cách BillionAir -->\n                    <div class=\"gates-array-row\">\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"01\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">01</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🥕</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"02\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">02</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🍯</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"03\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">03</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">✈️</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"05\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 28px;\">05</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">🌲</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-4\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Vào Ghế Ngồi Thôi! ✈️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-5\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cabin-seat-arena\">\n                    <!-- Ghế ngồi máy bay của Bin -->\n                    <div class=\"seat-plush-box\">\n                        <div id=\"safety-sign-lvl5\" class=\"safety-sign-led\">ĐÈN BÁO CÀI ĐAI</div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-seat-head\" style=\"font-size: 72px;\">🧒</div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-knight-cape\" class=\"knight-cape-icon\">🦸‍♂️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave left hidden\">〰️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave right hidden\">〰️</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Khóa đai & Nút uống nước -->\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n                        <div id=\"seatbelt-puzzle-lvl5\" class=\"seatbelt-puzzle\" style=\"background: #FFF; border-radius: 24px; padding: 14px;\">\n                            <div class=\"seatbelt-straps-row\">\n                                <div id=\"seatbelt-strap-lvl5\" class=\"strap-left\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-insert\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"strap-right\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-receiver\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <button id=\"btn-drink-water-lvl5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary hidden\" style=\"font-size: 18px; padding: 12px;\">\n                            🥤 Uống một ngụm nước\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Ngắm Mây Qua Cửa Sổ! ☁️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-6\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cloud-window-frame\">\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bunny\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 52px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 1</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"car\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 52px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 2</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"watermelon\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 52px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 3</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bear\">\n                        <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 52px;\">☁️</span>\n                        <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 4</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-6\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Học Nói Nhỏ Nhé! 🤫 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-7\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"etiquette-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tình huống 1: 3 Nút mức âm lượng -->\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 42px;\">👩‍🦰</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 18px;\">Nói Nhỏ Nhẹ Nhàng</span>\n                        <div class=\"volume-emotion-options\">\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"loud\" aria-label=\"Nói to\">😮</button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"medium\" aria-label=\"Nói vừa\">🙂</button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"whisper\" aria-label=\"Nói khẽ\">🤫</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Tình huống 2: Không đạp ghế trước -->\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 42px;\">💺</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 18px;\">Không Đạp Lưng Ghế</span>\n                        <button id=\"bin-leg-target\" style=\"font-size: 48px; border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer;\" title=\"Chạm để thu chân\">\n                            👟🦶\n                        </button>\n                        <span id=\"leg-status-label\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0277BD;\">Chạm để thu chân lại</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-7\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 14px; font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                    Máy Bay Hạ Cánh Rồi! 🛬 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 8: LẤY VALI & NHẬN PHẦN THƯỞNG\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-8\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-final-arena\">\n                    <!-- Bước 1: Máy bay dừng hẳn mới mở đai -->\n                    <button id=\"unbuckle-latch-btn\" class=\"tycoon-btn\" style=\"border: 3px dashed #78909C;\">\n                        <span>🔒 Chạm mở đai an toàn</span>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <!-- Băng chuyền hành lý -->\n                    <div id=\"baggage-carousel-lvl8\" class=\"carousel-track-chunky hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"carousel-suitcases-track\">\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: #2196F3;\" data-is-bin=\"false\">\n                                <span>🚀</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: #E91E63;\" data-is-bin=\"false\">\n                                <span>🍒</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <!-- Vali của Bin: Đỏ dán hình gấu -->\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: #E53935; border: 4px solid #FFD54F;\" data-is-bin=\"true\">\n                                <span>🐻</span>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"carousel-bag-tile\" style=\"background: #4CAF50;\" data-is-bin=\"false\">\n                                <span>⚽</span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Modal Huy Hiệu Vàng & Phần Thưởng -->\n                <div id=\"golden-medal-modal\" class=\"golden-medal-modal\">\n                    <div style=\"font-size: 64px;\">🎖️</div>\n                    <h2 style=\"font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #E65100; margin: 8px 0;\">HÀNH KHÁCH NHÍ XUẤT SẮC</h2>\n                    <div style=\"background: #E1F5FE; color: #0277BD; padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; display: inline-block;\">\n                        🌟 BÉ BIN ĐÃ HOÀN THÀNH CHUYẾN BAY ĐẦU TIÊN 🌟\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div style=\"margin: 14px 0;\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 72px;\">🛩️</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; color: #2E7D32;\">✨ Đã nhận Mô hình Máy Bay vào bộ sưu tập của Bin!</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button id=\"btn-replay-adventure\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary\" style=\"font-size: 20px; padding: 12px 28px;\">\n                        🔄 Chơi Lại Cùng Bin\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- MODAL CỔNG BA MẸ (3-SECOND PARENT CONTROL HUB) -->\n        <div id=\"parent-modal\" class=\"parent-modal-overlay\">\n            <div class=\"parent-control-card\">\n                <h2 style=\"color: #D84315; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">🛡️ Cổng Dành Cho Ba Mẹ</h2>\n                \n                <div class=\"parent-tip-box\">\n                    <strong>💡 Giảm khó chịu tai khi bay (Chuẩn Mayo Clinic):</strong> Khi cất cánh hoặc hạ cánh, cho bé ngồi thẳng và uống từng ngụm nước nhỏ để khuyến khích động tác nuốt, giúp tai dễ chịu hơn. Nếu bé đau tai nhiều hoặc đang có bệnh lý tai mũi họng, ba mẹ nên tham khảo ý kiến bác sĩ trước chuyến bay.\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"parent-tip-box\">\n                    <strong>💡 Chuẩn bị tâm lý trước chuyến đi:</strong> Cùng bé xem trước các bước trong ứng dụng này để bé làm quen với tiếng động cơ và không khí sân bay trước khi bay thực tế.\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Chọn nhanh màn chơi -->\n                <div style=\"margin: 12px 0;\">\n                    <strong style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #37474F;\">Chọn nhanh màn chơi:</strong>\n                    <div class=\"level-jump-grid\">\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"1\">1. Mặc đồ</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"2\">2. Xếp vali</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"3\">3. An ninh</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"4\">4. Cổng 03</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"5\">5. Đai đai</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"6\">6. Ngắm mây</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"7\">7. Lịch sự</button>\n                        <button class=\"jump-btn\" data-level=\"8\">8. Nhận vali</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Cài đặt âm thanh & chuyển động -->\n                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin: 10px 0; font-weight: 800;\">\n                    <span>Âm lượng hiệu ứng:</span>\n                    <input id=\"setting-volume\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.85\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 26px;\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin: 10px 0; font-weight: 800;\">\n                    <span>Chế độ Giảm chuyển động (Reduced Motion):</span>\n                    <input id=\"setting-reduced-motion\" type=\"checkbox\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\">\n                </div>\n\n                <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px;\">\n                    <button id=\"btn-reset-app\" class=\"tycoon-btn\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 16px;\">\n                        🔄 Chơi lại từ đầu\n                    </button>\n                    <button id=\"btn-close-parent\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary\" style=\"flex: 1; font-size: 16px;\">\n                        Đóng Bảng Cài Đặt ✓\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script src=\"js/audio.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"js/effects.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"js/app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Cập nhật index.html master theo phong cách Airport BillionAir và Parent-Co-Play","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\index.html","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update index.html"}}]}
